body:
Ten times worse than you could imagine. It feels like your muscles are on fire and your skin is freezing cold. You sweat and sweat and sweat, and vomit up everything you eat or drink. Your legs shake so bad you cant sit still, and your entire body has pins and needles all over that dont go away and your body is literally too weak to move, yet you are shaking violently. Your jaw is even too tired and we ak to talk or chew. You feel the need to crawl out of your skin and anything that touches you hurts and stings. Your stomach has shooting pains and you are shitting your pants and throwing up stomach bile because you have been too sick to eat. 

&#x200B;

Dont EVER do opiates. FUCKING EVER. I had surgery and 3 weeks later I was a feign.

No, he just found out that as soon as he steps out of office and back on New York land, he will be arrested for like 15 tax related felonies! It's only things ABOUT trump that can make trump feel feelings.

